Notice of Modified Files (Apache License 2.0, Section 4b):
========================================================================
The files this port changes relative to Neroued/ninfer are enumerated, each with the commit that
made the change, in docs/upstream-reports/fork-divergence.md. The Windows layer's own files are
those upstream does not have at all: src/artifact/file_io.cpp (Win32 unbuffered positional reads),
src/core/uint128.h (MSVC has no __int128), the launchers, the release tooling under tools/release,
and the Windows compiler and CUDA options in CMakeLists.txt and src/CMakeLists.txt.
